Subject: [PATCH 10/47] Drive the module from the control daemon

service.sh now just launches and respawns the daemon, which owns injection, harvest, and config resolution; customize.sh seeds config.json; sepolicy drops the KernelSU-specific rules for a manager-agnostic stream socket. target.txt is retired.
